From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] shell32: The known folders of Vista and later.

The table stopped at what Windows XP has, so Downloads, LocalLow, Saved
Games and the rest were not found, and a browser fell back to
Documents\Downloads. Music, Pictures, Videos and Downloads are in the
profile as since Vista, and what Public holds is under %PUBLIC%.
